# C9-08 fixture — "the launder": maps-to out, equivalent-to back.
stratum launder "A crafted chain claiming express past a lossy hop (gauntlet F8: it fails validation)."

term m "The manifest's type term."
term x "The lossy waypoint."
term t "The target the equivalence swings back to."
term visual "Loss: only appearance survives the m→x translation."

maps-to m -> x @loss = visual
equivalent-to x t
